1
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:30,080
Why did she suddenly faint?

2
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,570
Could it be His Majesty?

3
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,320
The doctor said

4
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,970
it's poisoned wine.

5
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,680
It was my negligence.

6
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:45,080
I shouldn't have let you enter the palace alone.

7
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:45,600
I didn't expect

8
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:48,440
my father to believe such absurd rumors about a demoness ruining the country.

9
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,770
It's truly ridiculous.

10
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,680
Jingxuan, His Majesty hasn't issued a clear edict to order her death.

11
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,740
As long as Miss Tang can survive this,

12
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,600
this matter will just blow over.

13
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,480
Your Highness,

14
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,840
Prince Yu is here.

15
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,440
What is he doing here?

16
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:08,120
He said he has a way to cure Miss Tang.

17
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,620
Let him in quickly.

18
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,400
You must be joking, Brother.

19
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,920
What emperor's destiny?

20
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:27,780
Do you also believe in such absurd things, Brother?

21
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,680
Whether it's true or false,

22
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,240
you'll know if you try.

23
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,680
Just do it for Miss Tang.

24
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:38,960
What?

25
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,320
You call it absurd,

26
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,640
but you actually believe it deeply.

27
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:46,860
Sixth Brother,

28
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:49,680
you need to decide on this matter early.

29
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,300
You can afford to wait.

30
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,380
But Miss Tang might not be able to.

31
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,079
Bad news, Your Highness!

32
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,560
Miss Tang is dying!

33
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,320
Miss Tang is dying!

34
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:33,620
Your Highness.

35
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,570
I never believed in supernatural forces.

36
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,690
But whether I believe it or not,

37
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:19,000
it's not as important as you staying alive.

38
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:46,159
Yiling witchcraft, Jingxuan.

39
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,600
Stop.

40
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,480
Using forbidden arts will bring backlash.

41
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,080
If you nourish him with your soul,

42
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:58,280
you will die for him in every lifetime,

43
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:03,570
ultimately completing his destiny through the suffering of reincarnation.

44
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,640
If he dies,

45
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:08,440
the world will be controlled by evil people like Yuwen Jia.

46
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:11,570
What kind of catastrophe will the common people suffer?

47
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:14,240
We gods cannot just sit back and watch.

48
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,320
Besides, if he dies,

49
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:20,180
not only will the world lose a wise ruler,

50
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,280
but the stars will also fall.

51
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:26,800
Our divine race will also face the fate of collapse.

52
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,880
But everything you've done for him,

53
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,680
before his destiny is restored,

54
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,210
he won't remember any of it.

55
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,240
Is it worth it?

56
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,680
I am willing.

57
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:53,080
I will find you in every lifetime,

58
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,360
awaken your memories,

59
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,040
until the heavenly punishment ends

60
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,260
and the stars return to their places.

61
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,360
Thank you.

62
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,880
Jingxuan.

63
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,560
Jingxuan.

64
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,860
Where is Miss Tang?

65
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,360
Miss Tang?

66
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,480
Who is that?

67
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,040
Miss Tang.

68
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,560
Zhiluo.

69
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,850
I remember everything.

70
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,500
Do you still remember who I am?

71
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,240
You are my disciple.

72
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,120
Zhiluo.

73
00:08:05,280 --> 00:08:06,940
I don't want to lose you again.

74
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,720
Please don't leave me again, okay?

75
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:17,320
We will never be apart again.

76
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:29,880
Bad news!

77
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:33,409
Yuwen Jia forged the military tally and is staging a rebellion!

78
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,280
I advise you to stop struggling.

79
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,680
His Majesty decrees:

80
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,480
The traitor Yuwen Jia

81
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,120
has abused his power,

82
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,120
disrupted the government, and brought disaster to the country.

83
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,980
He harbored disloyal intentions

84
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,080
and committed treasonous acts.

85
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:16,720
Prince Shuo is ordered to preside over the trial, assisted by the Three Judicial Offices,

86
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,720
to execute him according to the law.

87
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:43,040
The schedule for tomorrow's investiture ceremony has been delivered.

88
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:43,720
Su Zhiye.

89
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,370
Young Master Su,

90
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,800
I heard the result of the joint trial is out, right?

91
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:55,800
Treason is a grave crime.

92
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:56,800
The law is strict,

93
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:58,840
and he cannot escape the death penalty.

94
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,440
As for whether he will be beheaded in public

95
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,480
or granted poisoned wine or a white silk cord,

96
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,400
that depends on His Majesty's will.

97
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,760
But he is your Emperor's most beloved son.

98
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,360
So what if he is a beloved son?

99
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,480
In the struggle for imperial power,

100
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,480
who isn't a father, son, or brother?

101
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,440
Did you come to me

102
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,680
just to ask about his fate?

103
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:25,600
Su Zhiye,

104
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:28,000
can you do me a favor?
